---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
                Hey, welcome to my world! 
        </p>
	<p>
                
                I'm Mehrnaz — a computer science student who spends most of her time
                somewhere between low-level systems and the security holes hiding inside them.
                I like understanding how things actually work under the hood: how a process
                lives and dies in Windows, how memory gets managed (and mismanaged), and how
                all of it can break in interesting ways.
	</p>

	<p>
		My main playground is offensive security — penetration testing, reverse
                engineering, CTFs, and the kind of research that turns "wait, why does this
                work?" into a proper writeup. On the calmer days I write backend code, build
                things in Rust because I care about memory safety, and occasionally torture
                myself by implementing a C compiler from scratch
	</p>

	<p>
		This blog is where I dump what I learn: security notes, systems internals,
                Rust experiments, and whatever rabbit hole I've fallen into lately. Some posts
                are in English, some in Persian — the topic picks the language, not the other
                way around.
	</p>

	<p>
		Pull up a chair. It gets nerdy here. 
	</p>

	
</Layout>
